  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The head on desktop is limited to -35-45~ degrees of up/down motion from a third person view. The BetaIK does not take this limit into account, and will push the entire body forward/back once you've looked past that outside limit.\nClip explains it better:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/946881839400882196/969455978024173648/VRChat_2JLQUSBUdr.mp4\n\nI used the world Full Body Calibrate for the clip, as it has a third person camera available for desktop:\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a5e9ec13-36b1-4e63-ae0c-dab9023401f9",
